@startuml UC-11 审核通过
actor 药师
boundary "审方接口" as ReviewController
control "审方服务" as ReviewAppService
control "处方状态机" as PrescriptionStateMachine
entity "处方仓储" as PrescriptionRepository
entity "流转记录仓储" as FlowRecordRepository
药师 -> ReviewController : 提交审核通过（版本号）
ReviewController -> ReviewAppService : 审核通过(处方编号, 药师, 版本)
ReviewAppService -> PrescriptionRepository : 查询处方
ReviewAppService -> PrescriptionStateMachine : 执行通过迁移
PrescriptionStateMachine --> ReviewAppService : 目标状态为待核销
ReviewAppService -> ReviewAppService : 设置三天有效期
ReviewAppService -> PrescriptionRepository : 按版本更新
ReviewAppService -> FlowRecordRepository : 追加审核通过记录
ReviewAppService --> ReviewController : 返回结果或冲突
@enduml
